<title>USA: Minneapolis MC, Minn., $9.28 mln won by Dain.</title>
<headline>Minneapolis MC, Minn., $9.28 mln won by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it won $9.280 million of Minneapolis-St. Paul Metropolitan Council, Minn., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1997D, with a true interest cost of 4.528 percent.</p>
</text>
